sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React Web App (Axios Interceptor)
    participant Ctrl as AuthController
    participant Svc as AuthService
    participant Token as JwtTokenService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    Note over UI: AccessToken het han (401) -> Tu dong goi /refresh-token
    UI->>+Ctrl: 1. POST /api/v1/auth/refresh-token (Body hoac HttpOnly Cookie)
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 2. RefreshTokenAsync(refreshToken, clientIp, ct)
    Svc->>+Token: 3. HashToken(refreshToken) (SHA-256)
    Token-->>-Svc: 4. Return tokenHash
    
    Svc->>+DB: 5. SELECT * FROM refresh_tokens JOIN users WHERE token_hash = @hash
    
    alt Token khong ton tai trong DB
        DB-->>Svc: 6a. Return null
        Svc-->>Ctrl: 7a. Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-AUTH-05", "MSG-NTF-01")
        Ctrl-->>UI: 8a. 401 Unauthorized: Phien lam viec khong ton tai
    else Tim thay ban ghi RefreshToken
        DB-->>-Svc: 6b. Return existingToken
        
        alt Phat hien Replay Attack (existingToken.IsRevoked == true)
            Note over Svc: Canh bao bao mat! Ke tan cong dang tai su dung Token cu da thu hoi
            Svc->>+DB: 7b. UPDATE refresh_tokens SET is_revoked = true WHERE user_id = @uid
            DB-->>-Svc: 8b. Thu hoi toan bo phien dang nhap cua User (BR-AUTH-05)
            Svc-->>Ctrl: 9b. Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-AUTH-05", "MSG-AUTH-10")
            Ctrl-->>UI: 10b. 400/401: Phat hien bat thuong, buoc dang nhap lai
        else Token da het han 7 ngay (existingToken.ExpiresAt <= UtcNow)
            Svc->>+DB: 7c. UPDATE refresh_tokens SET is_revoked = true WHERE id = @id
            DB-->>-Svc: 8c. 1 row affected
            Svc-->>Ctrl: 9c. Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-AUTH-05", "MSG-NTF-01")
            Ctrl-->>UI: 10c. 401 Unauthorized: Phien lam viec da het han
        else Token hop le -> Thuc hien Token Rotation
            Svc->>+Token: 7d. GenerateRefreshToken() & GenerateAccessToken(user)
            Token-->>-Svc: 8d. Return newAccessToken + (newRawToken, newTokenHash)
            Note over Svc: Danh dau existingToken.IsRevoked = true<br/>existingToken.ReplacedByTokenHash = newTokenHash
            Svc->>+DB: 9d. UPDATE old refresh_token & INSERT new refresh_token
            DB-->>-Svc: 10d. 2 rows affected
            Svc-->>-Ctrl: 11d. Return AuthResponseDto { AccessToken, RefreshToken }
            Note over Ctrl: Cap nhat HttpOnly Cookie 'refreshToken' moi
            Ctrl-->>-UI: 12d. 200 OK: ApiResponse<AuthResponseDto> (MSG-GEN-01)
        end
    end

